From: OpenEmbedded <oe@oe-alliance.org>
Subject: [PATCH] libziparchive: add missing <cstdint> to zip_writer.h

GCC 15+ no longer transitively includes <cstdint> through other standard
headers, so uint8_t / uint16_t / uint32_t are no longer available in
zip_writer.h. The header itself uses these types (e.g. FileEntry struct
members, method signatures), so include <cstdint> explicitly.

Upstream-Status: Pending
Signed-off-by: OpenEmbedded <oe@oe-alliance.org>

--- a/system/libziparchive/include/ziparchive/zip_writer.h
+++ b/system/libziparchive/include/ziparchive/zip_writer.h
@@ -18,6 +18,7 @@

 #include <cstdio>
 #include <ctime>
+#include <cstdint>

 #include <gtest/gtest_prod.h>
 #include <memory>
